                                                <h1 class="text-size-four-xl font-weight-bold letter-spacing-tight text-gray-nine-hundred small-text-size-six-xl">Beauty, shaped around you</h1>
                                                <p class="margin-top-six text-size-large line-height-eight text-gray-six-hundred">
                                                      The Silk Canvas is a beauty salon concept for people who value a considered, personal approach to self-care. We believe an appointment should begin with a conversation: what you have in mind, what feels comfortable, and what you would like to know before making a choice. Our aim is to make the experience feel clear and welcoming, without pressure or one-size-fits-all promises. Explore the information on this page, then contact us to confirm
                                                      the salon’s current services, availability, accessibility details and address. Every person is different, and the right salon experience starts with understanding your preferences.
                                                </p>
