                                    <h1 class="title-font small-text-size-four-xl text-size-three-xl margin-bottom-four font-weight-bold text-yellow-five-hundred">A more considered salon experience</h1>
                                    <p class="margin-bottom-eight line-height-relaxed">Choosing a beauty salon is personal. The Silk Canvas presents a thoughtful approach that puts clear communication, comfort and individual preferences at the centre of the conversation. Use these principles as a guide when deciding whether the salon feels right for you, and ask any questions that would help you make an informed choice.</p>
                                    <div class="display-flex flex-wrap-mode margin-negative-four">
                                          <div class="padding-four large-width-one-half medium-width-full">
                                                <div class="height-full background-gray-eight-hundred background-opacity-seventy-five padding-six border-rounded-large shadow-large">
                                                      <h2 class="text-size-large font-weight-medium text-yellow-four-hundred title-font margin-bottom-two">A conversation before a choice</h2>
                                                      <p class="line-height-relaxed text-size-base">
                                                            A useful appointment starts with space to explain what you are looking for and ask questions. We encourage an open conversation about preferences, comfort and expectations before settling on a plan. This helps keep the process collaborative rather than prescriptive. If you are unsure what to request, you can describe the look or experience you have in mind and discuss the options directly with the salon before booking.
                                                      </p>
                                                </div>
                                          </div>
                                          <div class="padding-four large-width-one-half medium-width-full">
                                                <div class="height-full background-gray-eight-hundred background-opacity-seventy-five padding-six border-rounded-large shadow-large">
                                                      <h2 class="text-size-large font-weight-medium text-yellow-four-hundred title-font margin-bottom-two">Your comfort matters</h2>
                                                      <p class="line-height-relaxed text-size-base">
                                                            Feeling at ease is an important part of a salon visit. The Silk Canvas aims to create a welcoming tone where you can share preferences, raise concerns and take time to consider your choices. Everyone has different boundaries and needs, so clear communication can help shape a more comfortable appointment. Contact the salon in advance if you would like to ask about the setting or discuss any particular considerations.
                                                      </p>
                                                </div>
                                          </div>
                                          <div class="padding-four large-width-one-half medium-width-full margin-top-four">
                                                <div class="height-full background-gray-eight-hundred background-opacity-seventy-five padding-six border-rounded-large shadow-large">
                                                      <h2 class="text-size-large font-weight-medium text-yellow-four-hundred title-font margin-bottom-two">Clear, considered choices</h2>
                                                      <p class="line-height-relaxed text-size-base">
                                                            Beauty decisions should be made with a clear understanding of what is being discussed. We encourage you to ask about the proposed service, the process and any details that matter to you before deciding how to proceed. No particular result can be promised, because preferences and individual circumstances vary. A direct conversation with the salon is the best way to confirm current options and decide what feels appropriate for you.
                                                      </p>
                                                </div>
                                          </div>
                                          <div class="padding-four large-width-one-half medium-width-full margin-top-four">
                                                <div class="height-full background-gray-eight-hundred background-opacity-seventy-five padding-six border-rounded-large shadow-large">
                                                      <h2 class="text-size-large font-weight-medium text-yellow-four-hundred title-font margin-bottom-two">An individual approach</h2>
                                                      <p class="line-height-relaxed text-size-base">
                                                            There is no single version of beauty that suits everyone. The Silk Canvas recognises that personal style, comfort and expectations differ, and that a useful consultation should take those differences into account. Share what you like, what you would prefer to avoid and any questions you have. This gives you and the salon a basis for discussing an appointment that reflects your preferences, without assuming that one approach works for
                                                            all.
                                                      </p>
