                                          <p class="margin-top-six text-size-large line-height-eight text-gray-six-hundred">The Silk Canvas is presented around a simple idea: a beauty appointment should feel personal, considered and easy to discuss. Rather than relying on unverified figures, this section shares the principles that can help visitors decide what to ask and what matters to them.</p>
                                          <p class="margin-top-six text-size-large line-height-eight text-gray-six-hundred">We do not publish unverified customer numbers, ratings or service outcomes. Every visitor has different preferences, so the most useful next step is an individual conversation about current options, practical details and expectations. Please contact the salon to confirm information before making plans.</p>
