                              <h2 class="text-size-two-xl font-weight-bold line-height-ten letter-spacing-tight text-gray-nine-hundred">Frequently asked questions</h2>
                              <dl class="margin-top-ten space-y-eight divide-y-mode divide-gray-nine-hundred-ten-percent">
                                    <div class="padding-top-eight large-grid large-grid-columns-twelve large-gap-eight">
                                          <dt class="text-size-base font-weight-semibold line-height-seven text-gray-nine-hundred large-col-span-five">How can I find out which services are currently available?</dt>
                                          <dd class="margin-top-four large-col-span-seven large-margin-top-zero">
                                                <p class="text-size-base line-height-seven text-gray-six-hundred">Please contact The Silk Canvas directly to ask about its current services and any details relevant to your preferences. The information on this page does not confirm a specific service list.</p>
                                          </dd>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="padding-top-eight large-grid large-grid-columns-twelve large-gap-eight">
                                          <dt class="text-size-base font-weight-semibold line-height-seven text-gray-nine-hundred large-col-span-five">Can I discuss my preferences before making a decision?</dt>
                                          <dd class="margin-top-four large-col-span-seven large-margin-top-zero">
                                                <p class="text-size-base line-height-seven text-gray-six-hundred">Yes, you can get in touch to ask questions and explain what you are looking for. Confirm directly with the salon how it handles consultations and whether an appointment is needed for that conversation.</p>
                                          </dd>
                                    </div>
